WEBVTT

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:07.400
This is a very important place that embraced me,
despite how weak I really am.

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:10.900
But I need more...

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:12.950
More!

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:16.910
Karin-senpai!

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:22.750
U-Um... Can we get your autograph?

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:24.000
Sure.

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:26.960
Here you go.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.340
Thank you so much!

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:30.800
If you have an upcoming concert,
I'll definitely be there!

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:38.100
Ah, so it's because I'm a school idol
rather than a model.

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:41.970
What's wrong?

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:46.100
Some other students almost
spotted me as I was changing...

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:50.480
Does it really matter if people find out that
you're the student council president?

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:52.900
I can't let that happen!

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:54.570
Not to mention,

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:57.410
I've been thinking it's sort of cool
for a school idol not to

00:00:57.410 --> 00:01:01.540
reveal their true identity because
they're like some superhero.

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:03.540
You think so?

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:13.840
Looks like the club's popularity
is rising pretty well.

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:22.850
Everyone! There's a cute picture of me,
so I wanted to share.

00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:25.230
Squee.

00:01:25.230 --> 00:01:27.690
Oh, it is cute.

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:31.570
Right? Please praise me more.

00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:32.780
I was talking about the pandas.

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:35.030
Look at Kasumin, too, please!

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:41.620
I feel like a lot of random people
say hi to me now.

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:43.240
I guess it's happening to all of us.

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:47.580
At first, no one even knew about
the School Idol Club,

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:50.670
but perhaps things have changed due to
the PVs and Rina-san's concert.

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:52.800
Well, we've all been working hard.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:55.960
Yeah. Things are going great.

00:01:55.960 --> 00:02:00.050
Because things are going so well,
we should think about the future.

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:06.020
Though it's gradual, I believe that
we're all growing as solo idols.

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:12.190
But as the School Idol Club as a whole,
we haven't accomplished anything yet.

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:14.690
Our concert...

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:18.360
We talked about that
when we started the club back up.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:20.910
Maybe we could pull it off now.

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:23.780
You know, let's talk about it together again.

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:24.990
Yeah!

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:30.460
What's wrong?

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:32.500
It's Haruka-chan.

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:37.800
I hope I'm not interrupting.

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:41.140
You're welcome anytime!

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:42.890
What brings you here today?

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:44.220
Well...

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:47.770
We have something important to talk about.

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:49.770
Who are you?

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:51.480
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:53.900
I am a member of the
Touou Academy School Idol Club

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:57.190
and my name is Himeno Ayanokoji.

00:02:57.190 --> 00:02:59.490
Touou...

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:00.900
This may sound rather sudden,

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:05.410
but esteemed members of
the Nijigasaki High School Idol Club,

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:09.040
would you like to perform
in a concert with us?

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:13.830
What?!

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:21.180
<i>Let's go to the future!</i>
<i>Rainbow melodies</i>

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:33.940
<i>The rain clears up and reveals blue skies</i>

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:36.940
<i>The winds of hope blow (Blowing)</i>

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:41.860
<i>We can feel something coming</i>
<i>and we take our very first step</i>

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:44.620
<i>The world is sparkling</i>

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:47.620
<i>And our hearts start to
well up with (Feelings)</i>

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:52.000
<i>"We want to start running right now!!"</i>
<i>(Move on! Move on!)</i>

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:57.500
<i>The tiny melodies blend together (Our Colors)</i>

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:59.710
<i>Let's paint this arch, now</i>

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:03.300
<i>It resonates throughout the city</i>
<i>(Reaching for far blue sky!)</i>

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:05.470
<i>Let's sing together!</i>

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:11.270
<i>My feelings are overflowing,</i>
<i>there's no stopping them now</i>

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:13.940
<i>Rainbow-colored passions!!</i>

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.150
<i>Colors painted in courage</i>

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:18.820
<i>Let's create a bridge to the future</i>

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:22.280
<i>Beyond the endless sky</i>

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:24.610
<i>Resounding sympathy</i>

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:26.990
<i>Miracles are blooming</i>

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:30.200
<i>--Let's go! Shine towards
the future, melodies</i>

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:32.620
<i>--Yes, I know I'm not alone</i>
<i>--Let's go! Shine towards the future, melodies</i>

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:35.290
<i>You're all always by my side</i>

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:41.340
<i>So let's connect our dreams together</i>

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:47.140
Diver Fes?

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:51.100
That's the music event held
at Odaiba every year, isn't it?

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:55.020
Yes. Musicians from
various genres participate in it.

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:57.400
This year, Touou Academy
and Shinonome Academy

00:04:57.400 --> 00:05:01.110
have been invited to be in
the school idol category.

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:02.860
So I talked to Haruka-san,

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:07.780
and we had them include your school, as well.

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:10.950
Haruka-chan! Thank you so much!

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:14.910
But why, Ayanokoji-san?

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:21.880
It's because I heard your song
at the drama festival the other day.

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:26.050
I wanted to see what kind of concert
all of you would put on.

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:30.760
I've especially seen Karin Asaka-san
in a lot of magazines.

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:36.600
Being a popular magazine model and being
a school idol is rather charming, isn't it?

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:42.980
Th-Th-There'll be a lot of
people at this, won't there?

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:45.320
Yes. Around 3,000 people.

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:49.200
Three thousand... Eek!

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:55.000
Let's do it! We'll rarely have a chance
to perform at a concert this big again!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:58.620
But there's just one problem.

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:04.130
School idols will only be able to
perform three songs total.

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:08.680
Since Shinonome and Touou
are both groups, that won't be an issue,

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:12.760
but everyone from Nijigasaki are solo idols.

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:15.390
There're nine... so nine songs?

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:19.650
That's why we hesitated about inviting you.

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:25.110
But it's a nice opportunity for
a brand new club, isn't it?

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:26.320
Well...

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:27.950
Yes, but...

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:37.410
H-How about we do a medley?

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:39.420
That'd count as one song, right?

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:43.290
But with nine of us,
it'd easily be over ten minutes.

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:48.260
What should we do?

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:50.880
There's no point in dwelling on it.

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:55.640
Only one of us will be able to
perform on that stage.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:58.060
Let's decide who that's going to be.

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:12.570
H-How about we do a lottery?

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:14.700
Th-That's probably a good idea.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:18.040
No one can make a choice
so we're resorting to luck?

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:19.790
You're really okay with that?

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:20.790
Well, we're--

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:23.210
I know conflict can be scary,

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:25.840
but if we're just going to
hold back, there's no point.

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:31.840
Can you really say that
we grew as solo idols then?

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:35.100
Haruka-chan's one thing,

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:40.100
but I doubt Ayanokoji-san just invited us
out of the kindness of her heart.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:40.980
Huh?

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:43.310
Really?

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:48.150
Anyway, this concert is
going to test our club.

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:52.610
So we need to choose the member
who can face that head on.

00:07:57.790 --> 00:07:59.580
I'm going home for today.

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:05.630
Karin-chan.

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:16.930
Great job, everyone.

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:28.570
Did I go the wrong way again somewhere?

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:37.240
What?

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:46.420
Maybe I'll have Emma help me...

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:49.090
Huh?

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.050
Karin-san...

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:54.300
Are you shopping?

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.680
No...

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.220
Could it be...

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:59.970
...that you like stuff like this, too?!

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:00.970
Huh?

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:08.400
Here it is! I'm going to go buy this!

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:16.070
This is...

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:22.870
Apparently, they started carrying
school idol merchandise.

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:26.330
So we had Setsuna-chan bring us here.

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:27.540
Ah...

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:31.630
They have stuff from
Shinonome and Touou, too!

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:35.260
It's Ayanokoji-san. Wow!

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:36.840
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:39.140
Hey, they don't have merchandise of you?

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:42.100
Huh?! Of course not!

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:44.520
Though that is a bit disappointing.

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:49.610
I hope they'll have us
lined up here someday, too.

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:54.610
I should get going.

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:56.280
You had plans?

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:58.660
Sorry to distract you.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:03.330
It's fine. I just hope I make it in time.

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.040
Is this place far from here?

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:10.710
It shouldn't be, but the directions
are a bit confusing.

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:13.170
Do you know where this is?

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:15.630
Dance school?

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:21.890
You're already there!

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:28.940
You didn't realize it?

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:31.060
I can't believe you couldn't
tell from the map.

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:33.020
Do you happen to be bad with directions?

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:35.110
S-So what if I am?

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:37.650
It's surprising, but so cute.

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:42.620
So you're learning dance?

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:45.450
I just happened to meet
a teacher from here at work.

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:47.580
Way to go, Karin-san!

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:51.960
Indeed. I admire the effort
you're secretly putting in.

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:57.170
Well, if I don't, I won't be able to
catch up to my rivals.

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:00.970
I'm talking about all of you.

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:05.310
I just... can't let my guard down.

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:10.730
I do want to have fun
since I joined this club...

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:15.400
But I may have been a bit harsh yesterday.

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:16.570
I'm sorry.

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:19.110
Please don't apologize!

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:21.280
I think you were right, Karin-san.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:23.660
We are solo idols after all.

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:28.370
Yes. If we aren't disciplined,
we won't be able to grow.

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:34.380
And yet, I didn't want to trouble
all of you again, so I hesitated.

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:37.090
I think everyone else did, too.

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:41.510
Thank you for telling us the truth.

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:46.970
You're so earnest.

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:50.270
--You are, too, Karin-san.
--Huh?

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:53.190
Despite what you say,
you like taking care of everyone.

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:54.810
I think you're right.

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:56.980
You think so?

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:59.820
Do you have a little more time?

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:00.780
Yes...

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:05.450
Why don't we discuss who should
stand on the Diver Fes stage?

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:06.280
Huh?

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:07.700
Wait, we're deciding right now?

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:12.710
Yes. Because I'm sure that Karin-san's
true feelings have reached everyone.

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:18.500
I think this is necessary for us
as a club to take the next step.

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:19.710
What do you think?

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:22.630
I think it's a good idea.

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:28.720
Then I'll go contact everyone else.

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:39.940
We're solo idols and
friends, but we're rivals.

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:42.700
That's our...

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:59.630
Did you see the crowd?!
There're so many people out there!

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.710
I did! It's amazing!

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:04.760
I really wish I could've performed!

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:07.300
Well, we all wanted to.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:11.680
Though we all ended up
voting for someone else.

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:15.560
And well, there's only
one person for this job.

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.940
It looks perfect on you.

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:21.860
How does it fit?

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:24.110
It's perfect.

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:29.030
Thank goodness. I had a feeling
it'd look great on you.

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:31.240
I'm so excited!

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:34.500
We still have a while before
the school idols perform, right?

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:38.880
Yes. Even if things go as scheduled,
it won't be until evening.

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:42.210
In that case, I think I'm gonna
go look around the venue a bit more.

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.050
An opportunity like this
doesn't come up often.

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:45.970
I'll go with you.

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:53.310
Wow, there really are a lot of people!

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:59.560
Dance music, rock, pop...
and then school idols.

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:02.780
So many genres of music here!

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:05.690
I guess school idols are appearing, too.

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:07.910
Nijigasaki High School?
Have you heard of them?

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:09.320
No, I haven't.

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:11.910
More importantly, Mirage is performing!

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:13.870
No way!

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:19.170
That shouldn't be a surprise.
The fans here love all kinds of music.

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:24.670
Karin-san's going to sing
in a place like this...

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:34.430
So you're going to perform, Asaka-san?

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:35.810
Yes.

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:41.730
I'll put on the best performance I can
so that I don't embarrass the school.

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:46.900
Not as a model,
but as the school idol Karin Asaka.

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:54.280
Not all of the people here
are interested in school idols.

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:57.290
We're very much at a disadvantage.

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:03.210
Even then, I'd like them to know
what makes school idols so charming.

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:07.800
I truly admire the fact that you're going to
face them head on by yourself.

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:12.090
Let's both do our best.

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:13.850
Let us reconvene later.

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:38.450
Hello! We're the Shinonome Academy
School Idol Club!

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:41.290
The school idol block is about to begin!

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:43.710
Let's all have fun together!

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:48.840
Karin-san is late.

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:51.050
She's up soon...

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:53.550
And she left her smartphone.

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:56.310
Wait, did she get lost?!

00:15:56.310 --> 00:16:00.390
Huh? Oh, come on.
She's not a kid. There's no way...

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:01.350
Actually...

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:02.810
Seriously?!

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:04.310
We have to find her!

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:14.870
Karin-chan!

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:21.580
What's the matter?

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:26.750
Do you not feel well?

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:31.050
I'm just scared, that's all.

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:36.600
How pathetic, am I right?

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:40.980
I just happen to be feeling the pressure now.

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:44.310
Honestly, this is so pathetic.

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:47.060
After I had the nerve to say what I said...

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:50.730
I'm sorry.

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:01.200
That's not true.

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:09.920
You'll be okay, Karin-chan.

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:12.920
But at this rate...

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:14.340
You'll be okay.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:18.470
You have us.

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:23.140
Exactly. We may be solo idols,

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:25.310
but you're not all alone.

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:33.860
Why are you all so nice?

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:39.030
Isn't it obvious?
You shouldn't have to ask that.

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:55.880
Yeah, I'm all right.

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:58.050
Karin-senpai!

00:17:58.050 --> 00:18:02.600
Come on, high five!
I'll give you some of my energy.

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:22.950
Do great out there!

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:28.540
I'm going.

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:34.420
Where are you going, Yu-chan?

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:37.050
I want to cheer on Karin-san properly!

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:06.580
We're friends, but also rivals.

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:10.170
We're rivals...

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:12.250
...but they're my precious friends!

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:23.510
Just like a Rainbow Colors

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:31.020
The twinkling from the constellations

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:34.820
Spill down from the sky

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:38.320
Even though I close my eyes, it's so bright

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:42.110
They shine, they race
across so passionately

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:44.830
If I were alone

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:46.330
I never would've known

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:50.250
Weakness, pain, gloominess, all of it

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:56.960
I love when you smile and say you love me

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:59.380
Black or white

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:00.800
Yes or No

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:04.850
If it's never that simple

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:08.600
No one actually knows the answer

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:13.230
Let's create a future just as we want it

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:16.360
A vivid world

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:17.780
Please tell me

00:20:17.780 --> 00:20:20.070
Why my heart starts racing

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:21.740
When we're together

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:25.450
My choice as my new self

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:29.700
Will add color to my tomorrow

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:31.290
Find a way

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:32.960
If I'm with you

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:36.630
It's not so bad being lost

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:42.550
There is no one right answer or shine

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:47.100
Just like a Rainbow Colors...

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:01.900
That was lovely.

00:21:01.900 --> 00:21:05.410
Aren't you glad you got to
see Karin-san perform?

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:09.080
You've been a huge fan ever since
she debuted as a model, huh?

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:12.410
Oh, Misaki-san! Stop teasing me!

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:18.540
Hey, she's totally cool.

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:21.960
Yeah! I'd never seen them before,
but I think I like them!

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:50.660
<i>As we slowly run down this path</i>

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:54.540
<i>Something is trying to come to life</i>

00:21:54.540 --> 00:22:01.380
<i>I want to tell you, I want to tell you that</i>

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:04.170
<i>The sky that we look up at every day</i>

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:08.140
<i>Has a blue that changes with the seasons</i>

00:22:08.140 --> 00:22:14.770
<i>There are no rules, it's telling us</i>
<i>to depict it however we please</i>

00:22:14.770 --> 00:22:17.060
<i>Let's not be in a hurry!</i>

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:21.520
<i>Let's enjoy this thrilling time even more!</i>

00:22:21.520 --> 00:22:29.620
<i>Let's all pursue the things that we love</i>

00:22:30.530 --> 00:22:33.990
<i>We don't know where we're headed to just yet</i>

00:22:33.990 --> 00:22:37.080
<i>Hopefully, there's an exciting</i>
<i>future awaiting us</i>

00:22:37.080 --> 00:22:41.590
<i>It'd make me happy</i>
<i>if we can both smile about that</i>

00:22:41.590 --> 00:22:44.210
<i>Thank you again today</i>

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:47.470
<i>Now, let us open up our very own maps</i>

00:22:47.470 --> 00:22:50.640
<i>And casually take flight</i>

00:22:50.640 --> 00:22:55.930
<i>I want to dream, aspire, and dream once again</i>

00:22:55.930 --> 00:23:00.150
<i>I just want to keep dreaming!</i>

00:23:03.570 --> 00:23:07.820
I really, really wanted to
perform at Diver Fes!

00:23:07.820 --> 00:23:09.530
Me, too!

00:23:09.530 --> 00:23:13.990
Karin was just gleaming
up on that stage. I was so jealous!

00:23:13.990 --> 00:23:15.700
Well, there's still next time.

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:18.710
Our concert, remember?

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:22.420
Yeah!

00:23:22.420 --> 00:23:23.750
Let's do it!

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:25.090
Yeah!

00:23:25.090 --> 00:23:29.260
In that case, since we're on the subject,
let's hold a training camp!

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:31.720
Ooh, sounds fun!

00:23:31.720 --> 00:23:34.600
Yeah, let's do it!

00:23:36.270 --> 00:23:39.310
Next time, "Summer Begins."
